title: II <span style="color: var(--radix-main);"><strong>RADIX Front</strong></span> Congress
subtitle: The <span style="color: var(--vp);"><strong>VPs</strong></span> hold a party conference.
view-if: year = 9377 and month = 12 and week = 1
max-visits: 1
tags: event
new-page: true

= II <span style="color: var(--radix-main);"><strong>RADIX Front</strong></span> Congress

The <span style="color: var(--radix-main);"><strong>RADIX Front</strong></span> has reconvened two weeks after its first session was violently interrupted.

Our main priority, of course, is the election of a new General Secretary, to succeed McReformface.

WIP.

- @conference: The delegates enter...

@conference
on-arrival: {!
    Q.communist_strength = Math.round(Q.communist_strength * 10) / 10;
    Q.left_strength = Math.round(Q.left_strength * 10) / 10;
    Q.center_strength = Math.round(Q.center_strength * 10) / 10;
    Q.labor_strength = Math.round(Q.labor_strength * 10) / 10;
    Q.reformist_strength = Math.round(Q.reformist_strength * 10) / 10;
    Q.neorevisionist_strength = Math.round(Q.neorevisionist_strength * 10) / 10;
    Q.right_strength = Math.round(Q.right_strength * 10) / 10;
!}
on-display: {!
data = [
    {
        "id": "communist",
        "legend": "Communists",
        "name": "Communists",
        "seats": Q.communist_strength*5,
    }];
data = data.concat([
    {
        "id": "left",
        "legend": "Left",
        "name": "Left",
        "seats": Q.left_strength*5,
    },
    {
        "id": "center",
        "legend": "Center",
        "name": "Center",
        "seats": Q.center_strength*5,
    },
    {
        "id": "labor",
        "legend": "Labor",
        "name": "Labor",
        "seats": Q.labor_strength*5,
    },
    {
        "id": "reformist",
        "legend": "Reformists",
        "name": "Reformists",
        "seats": Q.reformist_strength*5,
    },
    {
        "id": "neorevisionist",
        "legend": "Neorevisionists",
        "name": "Neorevisionists",
        "seats": Q.neorevisionist_strength*5,
    },
    {
        "id": "right",
        "legend": "Right",
        "name": "Right",
        "seats": Q.right_strength*5,
    },
]);
if (d3 && window) {
    // get screen width
    var width = 500;
    var height = 500;
    var screenWidth = document.getElementById('content').offsetWidth;
    if (screenWidth < width - 50) {
        width = screenWidth - 50;
        height = width;
        document.getElementById("reichstag").style.height = screenWidth/2 + "px";
    }
    var parliament = d3.parliament();
    parliament.width(width).height(height).innerRadiusCoef(0.4);
    parliament.enter.fromCenter(true).smallToBig(true);
    parliament.exit.toCenter(false).bigToSmall(true);
    d3.select("#reichstag").datum(data).call(parliament);
}
!}

{!<svg id="reichstag" style="width: 500px; height: 250px;"> </svg>!}

{!<table>!}
{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:var(--communist)'> </div></td> <td>!}Communists: {!</td><td>!} [+ communist_strength +]% {!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:var(--left)'> </div></td> <td>!}Left: {!</td><td>!} [+ left_strength +]% {!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:var(--center)'> </div></td> <td>!}Center: {!</td><td>!} [+ center_strength +]% {!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:var(--labor)'> </div></td><td>!}Labor: {!</td><td>!} [+ labor_strength +]% {!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:var(--reformist)'> </div></td><td>!}Reformists: {!</td><td>!} [+ reformist_strength +]% {!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:var(--neorev)'> </div></td> <td>!}NeoRevs: {!</td><td>!} [+ neorevisionist_strength +]% {!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="box" style='background-color:var(--right)'> </div></td> <td>!}Right: {!</td><td>!} [+ right_strength +]% {!</td></tr>!}
{!</table>!}

The first matter in the conference is the program to appeal to stoopid workers. (This is a placeholder.)

- @yesProgram: The program is adopted!
- @noProgram: The program is rejected.

@yesProgram
unavailable-subtitle: The Left and Center lack enough votes.
subtitle: WIP.
choose-if: left_strength + neorevisionist_strength + center_strength > 50
on-arrival: labor_strength -= 3; workers_spd += 2; workers_rpls -= 2; urban_program = 1;

The urban program has been adopted! This will make it easier to expand our reach beyond rural areas.

@noProgram
unavailable-subtitle: The Reformists and Labor lack enough votes.
subtitle: WIP.
choose-if: neorevisionist_strength + labor_strength + reformist_strength > 50

The urban program is not adopted.
